-- Source module: Solutions.R6CrtMain
/-!
# CRT reversal §6: the nine phases of the additive-swap reversal

`mainU = L(-σ) S L(σ) L(-1) S L(1) S L(σ) L(-1)` (execution order; `L(±σ)` = `lsU true ·`,
`L(±1)` = `lsU false ·`, `S` = `swpU`). **`mainU_runs`**: on data `xs` of shape `SH n Q T` it
computes `pull … (word Q n) xs`, i.e. (by `word_rev`) the reversal of the `n` main digits.
-/

